{"id":"0f04b1f6787215b0","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-locale-opens-recovery.md","title":"Theorem — locale 的开集恢复","display":"Theorem — locale 的开集恢复","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-locale-opens-recovery","aliases":["14-thm-locale-opens-recovery"],"display":"Theorem — locale 的开集恢复","depends_on":["[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]"],"source_location":"IX.5 equation (2), printed 488; DjVu 250; compare III.8 equation (17)","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-locale-opens-recovery"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-locale-opens-recovery</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — locale 的开集恢复"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bcaaa430e12534f8\" href=\"?note=bcaaa430e12534f8\" title=\"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves\">14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IX.5 equation (2), printed 488; DjVu 250; compare III.8 equation (17)"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为 locale，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathcal O(X)\">\\(L=\\mathcal O(X)\\)</span>，开集层见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bcaaa430e12534f8\" href=\"?note=bcaaa430e12534f8\" title=\"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves\">14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 为层范畴终对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_Xa=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)\">\\(y_Xa=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的可表次终层，其唯一到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的箭头记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_a\">\\(\\iota_a\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>子对象序和顶采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>，二元交 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_1\">\\(\\wedge_1\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_X\">\\(\\Theta_X\\)</span> 是下式定义的映射；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq|L|\">\\(S\\subseteq|L|\\)</span> 的上确界保持以下式的最小上界性质表达。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_X:|L|\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(1),\\qquad\\Theta_X(a):=[\\iota_a].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta_X:|L|\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(1),\\qquad\\Theta_X(a):=[\\iota_a].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(1)\\ \\exists!a\\in|L|\\ (\\Theta_X(a)=B),\\qquad\\Theta_X(\\top_L)=\\top_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(1)\\ \\exists!a\\in|L|\\ (\\Theta_X(a)=B),\\qquad\\Theta_X(\\top_L)=\\top_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (\\Theta_X(a\\wedge_Lb)=\\Theta_X(a)\\wedge_1\\Theta_X(b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (\\Theta_X(a\\wedge_Lb)=\\Theta_X(a)\\wedge_1\\Theta_X(b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\subseteq|L|\\ \\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(1)\\ \\left(\\Theta_X(\\bigvee_LS)\\le_1 B\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in S\\ (\\Theta_X(a)\\le_1 B)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S\\subseteq|L|\\ \\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(1)\\ \\left(\\Theta_X(\\bigvee_LS)\\le_1 B\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in S\\ (\\Theta_X(a)\\le_1 B)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.5 式 (2)，印刷 488，DjVu 250；原文同时回指 III.8 式 (17)。每个次终层对应一个向下闭且对覆盖并封闭的开集族；取全部成员的上确界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，其生成覆盖筛的源集仍在该族中，层条件使该族包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，故正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow a\">\\(\\downarrow a\\)</span>。因此每个次终子对象唯一对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_Xa\">\\(y_Xa\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_Xa\\le y_Xb\">\\(y_Xa\\le y_Xb\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\">\\(a\\le b\\)</span>：正向在对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 处检查恒等箭头，反向由包含得到。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_X\">\\(\\Theta_X\\)</span> 是序同构，保顶、二元交及任意子集的最小上界；最后一式明确包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\varnothing\">\\(S=\\varnothing\\)</span> 的底。这些公式完整表达所恢复的框架结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head